    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753540/extras/34536db0c15b91f525115cadcf856dda.poster.avif?t=1735901531\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753540/extras/34536db0c15b91f525115cadcf856dda.webm?t=1735901531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753540/extras/34536db0c15b91f525115cadcf856dda.mp4?t=1735901531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>The rules are simple:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect carrots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Spend carrots on decorations and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect more carrots </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to make the bunnies happy <br><br>You can invite kids to help you collect carrots, but be careful, they leave a mess behind, and that makes the bunnies unhappy. You can always clean the mess or make toys out of it! But for that...you need to upgrade your farm.\u00a0<br> Just like in other clicker games, you\u2019ll open more upgrades as soon as you refresh your farm to start all over again.\u00a0<br><br> And did we tell you about the cute bunnies?</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753540/extras/34536db0c15b91f525115cadcf856dda.poster.avif?t=1735901531\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753540/extras/34536db0c15b91f525115cadcf856dda.webm?t=1735901531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753540/extras/34536db0c15b91f525115cadcf856dda.mp4?t=1735901531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>The rules are simple:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect carrots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Spend carrots on decorations and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect more carrots </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to make the bunnies happy <br><br>You can invite kids to help you collect carrots, but be careful, they leave a mess behind, and that makes the bunnies unhappy. You can always clean the mess or make toys out of it! But for that...you need to upgrade your farm.\u00a0<br> Just like in other clicker games, you\u2019ll open more upgrades as soon as you refresh your farm to start all over again.\u00a0<br><br> And did we tell you about the cute bunnies?</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Bunny Clicker is a cozy idle game where you can raise your cute bunnies on a small farm. Breed them, feed and play with them to earn more carrots and improve their quality of life.",
